    "method_note": "Ageing proxy = 5-year net UIO change from UIO.xlsx (latest vs −5y), not mean vehicle age. Hypothesis: shrinking parks leave older vehicles → harder repairs → lower fill. Positive r supports younger/growing ↔ higher fill."
